%% Planned support sequence, v0.1.0, 2026-10-24.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant UI as React interface
    participant API as FastAPI orchestrator
    participant DB as Local database
    participant Router as Classifier and routing rules
    participant Retrieval as Local knowledge retrieval
    participant Adapter as Guarded model adapter
    participant OR as OpenRouter
    actor Staff as Support staff

    Customer->>UI: Send support message
    UI->>API: Message with session credential
    API->>DB: Validate session, permissions, and conversation ownership
    DB-->>API: Authorized context or denial
    alt Access denied or authentication required
        API-->>UI: Explain required sign-in without exposing private data
    else Authorized
        API->>DB: Store incoming message and read ownership state
        alt Conversation is handoff_pending or human_owned
            API->>DB: Append to waiting ticket or assigned staff inbox
            API-->>UI: Transport acknowledgment that message was recorded
            Note over API,OR: No assistant generation or bot reply in either handoff state
        else Assistant owns conversation
            API->>Router: Classify intent and apply routing rules
            Router-->>API: Self-service route or handoff reason
            alt Customer requests a person or routing requires review
                API->>DB: Create or reuse active ticket, set handoff_pending, and record summary
                API-->>UI: Acknowledge handoff and show actual queue status
            else Bounded self-service request
                opt Order-specific request
                    API->>DB: Verify order ownership and fetch current allowed facts
                    DB-->>API: Permitted facts or non-disclosing rejection
                end
                API->>Retrieval: Retrieve approved policy chunks when required
                Retrieval->>DB: Search versioned knowledge with local embeddings
                DB-->>Retrieval: Approved chunks and source versions
                Retrieval-->>API: Evidence or evidence unavailable
                alt Authorized facts or policy evidence sufficient
                    API->>Adapter: Minimal redacted context and bounded answer request
                    Adapter->>OR: Check selected route pricing metadata
                    OR-->>Adapter: Metadata or failure
                    Note over Adapter: Require explicit allowlist, reviewed license, and zero-cost eligibility
                    alt Route is eligible
                        Adapter->>OR: Request grounded answer with bounded timeout and retries
                        alt Model returns a usable answer
                            OR-->>Adapter: Answer draft
                            Adapter-->>API: Draft with model and outcome metadata
                            API->>API: Check evidence references and response constraints
                            alt Answer passes checks
                                API->>DB: Atomically recheck conversation ownership before publishing
                                alt Assistant still owns conversation
                                    API->>DB: Save answer, citations, and generation metadata
                                    API-->>UI: Answer with supporting references
                                else Handoff started or staff claimed conversation
                                    API->>DB: Record suppressed generation outcome
                                    Note over API,UI: Do not publish the in-flight assistant answer
                                end
                            else Answer cannot be supported
                                API->>DB: Record failure and create or reuse handoff ticket
                                API-->>UI: Explain limitation and acknowledge handoff
                            end
                        else Timeout, quota, or model error
                            OR-->>Adapter: Failure or unavailable response
                            Adapter-->>API: Explicit generation failure
                            API->>DB: Record outcome and create or reuse handoff ticket
                            API-->>UI: Useful deterministic fallback and handoff status
                        end
                    else Route unavailable or eligibility unverified
                        Adapter-->>API: Generation disabled without paid fallback
                        API->>DB: Record reason and create or reuse handoff ticket
                        API-->>UI: Useful deterministic fallback and handoff status
                    end
                else Missing evidence or unauthorized order context
                    API->>DB: Create or reuse ticket with safe context and reason
                    API-->>UI: Request needed information or acknowledge handoff
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over API,DB: Every new handoff atomically records the ticket and sets handoff_pending

    opt A handoff ticket is waiting
        Staff->>API: Accept ticket through authorized dashboard
        API->>DB: Atomically assign ticket and set human_owned
        DB-->>API: Ownership recorded
        API-->>Staff: History, evidence, attempted actions, and summary
        Staff->>API: Send support response
        API->>DB: Save staff message and audit event
        API-->>UI: Human support response
    end

    Note over API,DB: Every automated reply path rechecks ownership before publishing
    Note over API,DB: Material changes use a separate confirmed, revalidated, transactional action workflow
